		(property "Description" "RS PRO C14 IEC inlet, snap-in, 6A 250V, 1x fuse holder 5x20mm, illuminated DPST switch, 4.8x0.8 faston/solder tabs. DATASHEET DRAWING NOT TEXT-READABLE: pins are named by function (mains side L_IN/N_IN, switched side L_OUT/N_OUT, PE) - map to physical tabs from the drawing/label. Fuse is in the line path (check which conductor on your part)."
			(at 43.18 43.18 0)
