		(property "Description" "Adafruit NAU7802 24-bit ADC breakout, STEMMA QT/Qwiic, I2C 0x2A. E+/E- = bridge excitation (E+ = on-chip AVDD 2.4-4.0V), A+/A- = channel 1 diff input, B+/B- = channel 2 diff input (current rev with 6-pin terminal block). Pin numbers are LOGICAL. AV header pin is the same AVDD node as E+."
			(at 41.91 125.73 0)
