		(property "Description" "SparkFun Qwiic Mux Breakout 8-channel (TCA9548A), I2C 0x70-0x77, 1.65-5.5V. Module symbol (not bare IC). Pin numbers are LOGICAL, not physical header order. ADR0-2 = address solder jumpers. Main Qwiic connectors (x2, pass-through) are electrically the same as 3V3/GND/SDA/SCL."
